WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:04.667
People keep saying DevRel. What does it actually mean?

2
00:00:08.333 --> 00:00:13.333
Most think it's just someone who goes to conferences and talks code.

3
00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:16.667
That's not even half of it.

4
00:00:19.333 --> 00:00:23.667
DevRel stands for Developer Relations.

5
00:00:23.833 --> 00:00:29.333
The bridge between a company's product and the developer community.

6
00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:40.667
Three jobs at once: Educator, Advocate, Community Builder.

7
00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:46.333
They write docs, build tutorials, and listen to developer feedback.

8
00:00:53.333 --> 00:00:58.333
In Web3, DevRel is critical. If no one builds on your chain,

9
00:00:58.500 --> 00:01:03.333
your chain doesn't matter. DevRel makes builders love the product.

10
00:01:03.667 --> 00:01:08.667
Learn how to build your career in Web3 at 0xverse Academy.

